Z||000000||HF6582||01-25-2000||07:44 PM||||What dash guages are driven through the ecm, if any?<BR>Thank You<BR>Scott||||reg||5
Z||000001||ka4nkf||01-25-2000||09:09 PM||||The only one i can think of is the check engine light.||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||01-26-2000||12:40 AM||||None, Only the Check/Service Engine light is ECM controlled.<P>On the other hand the ECM gets it's speed input from a 1/2 speedo sensor output on the speedometer control logic. (4000ppm to the speedo = 2000ppm to the ECM from the speedo.)<P>Depending on year in question some functions that are individiual sensors eventually move to the ECM. Radiator fan control being one that moved to the ECM in 87 on the 4 cyl. In no case did dash instruments change.||||reg||1
Z||000003||terryk||01-26-2000||11:59 AM||||CE and shift lamp on a manual.||||reg||1
